Z||000000||4Banger Bandit||08-04-99||05:28 PM||||I recently traded my '84 in for an'85 with a gt nose, but a shitty thing happened.  I was playing with the parking brake and the light came on, but I can't get the parking brake to go off.  I know how our Fiero parking brakes work, but the lever on this one is broken, and I can hear a feint shrieking noise coming from the wheels now that the light is on.  Does anyone know how to do-away with the parking brake?  I have an auto anyways. thanks..
Z||000001||batboy||08-04-99||07:33 PM||||I'm not sure which lever you mean, but you might try disconnecting the cables at the rear calipers to see if that cures the problem, then you can have more time to figure out the problem and fix it.
